Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=20}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.20,0:02:03.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, quit slackin' off!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.66,0:02:04.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.36,0:02:05.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, chore boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.23,0:02:07.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wash the windows when\Nyou're finished here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.17,0:02:08.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.14,0:02:11.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One, two, three, four.\NOne, two, three, four.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.27,0:02:13.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One, two, three,\Nfour. One, two...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.95,0:02:19.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh... I can't stand this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.15,0:02:23.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Koby can be the model chore boy if\Nhe wants, but why do I have to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.55,0:02:26.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.55,0:02:30.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for that stupid straw hat\Nguy, none of this would of happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.39,0:02:33.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's all his fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.43,0:02:35.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's because of that straw\Nhat guy that I'm here
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.30,0:02:38.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,doing stupid chores instead\Nof living the good life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.27,0:02:39.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Helmeppo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.33,0:02:41.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What d'ya want? Why are\Nyou touching me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.69,0:02:43.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't blame\Neverything on Luffy like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.89,0:02:46.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It isn't his fault; he was just\Ndoing the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.35,0:02:48.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For a long time you could\Nuse your father's power
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.95,0:02:51.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to get through life.\NThings are different now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.62,0:02:55.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've got to work long and hard on\Nour own to accomplish our dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.59,0:02:56.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.93,0:02:58.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know my dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.63,0:03:01.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Someday I'm gonna become a\Ngreat officer in the marines!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.70,0:03:05.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll chase bad guys and defend justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.63,0:03:09.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How stupid can you be?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.29,0:03:12.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A wimp like you becoming a\Nmarine officer like my dad?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.16,0:03:13.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No way that will ever happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.53,0:03:14.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know that it will!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.80,0:03:18.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Luffy, I know that\NI can do anything that I want!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.22,0:03:20.87,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(0,0,1,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H525252&\4c&H000000&)\t(0,0,1,\alpha&HFF&)\t(0,0,1,\alpha&H00&)\t(1855,0,1.1,\c&H181918&\3c&H181918&\4c&H181918&)}That's right! I'm gonna\Nbe King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.87,0:03:25.35,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(0,140,1,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H525252&\4c&H000000&)\t(3584,0,1.1,\c&H1B1E1E&\3c&H1B1E1E&\4c&H1B1E1E&)}I decided that long ago, and if I die\Nfighting for it, it's all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.35,0:03:27.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So I decided to be\Nlike Luffy and do anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.76,0:03:30.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,even risk my life, to\Nachieve my final goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.97,0:03:32.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.01,0:03:34.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now we can work hard and\Nreach our goals together!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.54,0:03:36.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Forget it! You think I'm\Ngoing to listen to this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.81,0:03:38.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the heck makes you\Nthink you can tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.59,0:03:41.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,what I should do?! And what\Ncould you have possibly learned
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.26,0:03:43.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,from that pathetic excuse for a pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.19,0:03:45.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't talk about Luffy like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.13,0:03:47.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I haven't done anything\Nbut try to help you out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.53,0:03:50.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't remember asking for your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.80,0:03:54.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Helmeppo, will you please\Njust stop acting foolish?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.31,0:03:56.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, please! You're calling me a fool?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.27,0:03:57.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.04,0:03:58.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Would you snap out of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.54,0:04:00.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.98,0:04:21.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– We're... We're sorry, sir!\N– We're... We're sorry, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.58,0:04:27.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Really? That explosion\Nearlier was from you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:30.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They didn't kick you out\Nof the marines, did they, Koby?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.62,0:04:31.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.69,0:04:35.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, they actually allowed\Nus to stay enlisted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.63,0:04:39.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but we had to agree to\Nwork for free for 50 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.60,0:04:42.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Getting kicked out would\Nhave been so much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.61,0:04:45.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.15,0:04:52.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will now inform you about\Nthe nature of our mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.12,0:04:53.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.29,0:04:54.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.26,0:04:58.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's my dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.59,0:05:01.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Captain Morgan is being\Nsent to Marine Headquarters
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.43,0:05:04.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to face a court martial for the\Ncrimes of military exploitation
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.80,0:05:07.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and the cruel and unusual\Ntreatment of civilians.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.60,0:05:11.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our mission is to transfer the\Nprisoner to Vice-Admiral Garp.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.74,0:05:13.78,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Rankless, low-life bums!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.78,0:05:16.48,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,You have no right to\Ndefy my superiority!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.48,0:05:19.11,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I am Marine Captain Axe-hand Morgan
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.29,0:05:35.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So I guess it's really going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.06,0:05:39.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I mean, I know that he deserves to get\Ncourt-martialed and all of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.80,0:05:44.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I get it, given the stuff\Nthat he did, but honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.24,0:05:47.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,even after all that,\NI still respected him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.85,0:05:59.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.68,0:06:03.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why? 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.56,0:06:07.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Koby, do you think that they're\Ngoing to execute him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.33,0:06:10.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.26,0:06:14.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess I should probably be ready for\Nsomething like that to happen, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.83,0:06:17.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But he's my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.53,0:06:24.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Helmeppo...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.43,0:06:27.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Marines! All hands on deck!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.76,0:06:29.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fall in!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.90,0:06:34.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's Vice-Admiral Garp!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.96,0:06:42.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}So that's Marine Vice-Admiral Garp!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.67,0:06:44.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The man they call the Fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.64,0:06:48.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's a great hero of the seas who\Ntravels all over the Grand Line!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.79,0:06:58.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vice-Admiral Garp, thank you\Nfor coming all this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.58,0:07:05.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We are pleased to deliver\NCaptain Morgan to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.39,0:07:06.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dad! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.49,0:07:09.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sir, did you hear me Vice-Admiral?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.89,0:07:11.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vice-Admiral Garp, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.46,0:07:14.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Be quiet! I heard you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.40,0:07:17.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm a bit tired because I've\Nbeen up for five days now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.69,0:07:19.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You are indeed a dedicated marine, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.76,0:07:21.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, I've been trying to set a record
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.53,0:07:23.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,for the most doughnuts eaten\Nin a single sitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.63,0:07:24.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.70,0:07:28.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The sugar kept me going at first,\Nbut I've been at it for a while now,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.03,0:07:30.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and I guess the lack of sleep\Nis starting to get to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.63,0:07:35.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Old man. Cut the sleeping act already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.30,0:07:45.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No one move!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.94,0:07:53.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}If anyone moves a muscle I'll hack this\Nchore boy up and feed him to the sharks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.31,0:07:55.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,B-But daddy, why are you doing this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.31,0:07:58.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sir, please stop this!\NHelmeppo is your son!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.01,0:08:00.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How could you do something\Nlike that to him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.08,0:08:02.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My son? What do I need with a son?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.65,0:08:04.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What I want now is freedom!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.65,0:08:06.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't care about his life!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.32,0:08:09.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll cut him into a thousand\Npieces if I have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.65,0:08:12.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But... Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.59,0:08:16.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! Help me! Somebody help me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.79,0:08:18.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good riddance, you fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.19,0:08:20.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Helmeppo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.06,0:08:21.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ready the cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.00,0:08:23.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Load the cannon! Take aim!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.73,0:08:25.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Target, 16 degrees starboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.83,0:08:28.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Distance... eight-two-six-three.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.40,0:08:29.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.86,0:08:32.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,N-N-No, please just wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.55,0:08:38.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you not to\Nshoot! Please, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.68,0:08:41.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He has a hostage on that boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.19,0:08:42.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.32,0:08:44.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.72,0:08:46.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In that case, you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.28,0:08:52.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maybe so, but at least I won't be\Nguilty of abandoning my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.09,0:08:55.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please, I can fix this! I'll\Ncapture Morgan myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.80,0:09:08.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.50,0:09:09.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.50,0:09:11.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll never be able to\Ncapture him by yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.94,0:09:13.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's let him try.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.51,0:09:17.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's either brave or\Ndumb, or just... dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.48,0:09:21.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.36,0:09:30.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm awake again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.03,0:09:31.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, what's all this noise about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.40,0:09:33.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vice-Admiral Garp, you're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.04,0:09:35.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was certain that that\Nmonster had killed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.07,0:09:37.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?! One of the men has been killed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.74,0:09:41.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I slept through\Nsomething like that! Who was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.55,0:09:47.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.56,0:09:49.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Aiye!\N– Aiye!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.66,0:09:53.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Free at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.33,0:09:54.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just you watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.53,0:09:57.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The world will be kneeling at\Nmy feet again in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.37,0:09:58.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will rule the seas!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.96,0:10:00.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The world will quake in terror!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.74,0:10:03.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now set our course to the west, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.66,0:10:05.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?\NI said set our course!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.90,0:10:06.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.74,0:10:07.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.74,0:10:09.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't have any part in your plans!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.91,0:10:12.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Koby put everything on the\Nline trying to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.78,0:10:16.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}He even risked getting kicked out of the\Nmarines to help me and they're his dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.18,0:10:20.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He fights for what he believes in,\Nno matter what, and so could I!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.03,0:10:23.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dad, I'm going to capture you!\NYou might as well just give up...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.73,0:10:26.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing, brat?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.90,0:10:29.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you too stupid to know\Nwhat you're up against, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.80,0:10:33.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What can a useless piece of scum\Nlike you hope to do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.05,0:10:35.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.35,0:10:37.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's time you learned\Nyour place, you pathetic insect!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.89,0:10:40.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not listening to you anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.06,0:10:43.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,From now on, I'm the one who's\Ngoing to decide how to live my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.06,0:10:45.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop being such an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.56,0:10:47.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What can someone like you possibly do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.90,0:10:50.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He can do whatever he wants!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.94,0:10:52.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You came!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.74,0:10:54.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop right there, Morgan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.76,0:11:03.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You two are absolutely pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.86,0:11:07.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}How can a couple of pitiful insects like\Nyou expect to capture someone like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.83,0:11:11.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you even think about getting\Nin my way, I'll kill you both!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.33,0:11:12.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.70,0:11:14.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry it turned out like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.50,0:11:16.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I came!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.47,0:11:18.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aren't we friends, after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.18,0:11:20.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Koby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.27,0:11:28.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You little pests aren't worth\Nthe time it would take to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.44,0:11:31.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd better never see your faces again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.14,0:11:32.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Morgan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.21,0:11:33.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.28,0:11:36.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I may have let you sail away\Nfrom here alive today,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.15,0:11:39.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but someday I'm going to catch\Nyou! I promise you that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.28,0:11:42.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you hear me? Someday\NI'm going to capture you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.32,0:11:44.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just you wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.89,0:11:50.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please forgive\Nmy poor supervision, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.22,0:11:52.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Allowing the prisoner to\Nescape was inexcusable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.96,0:11:55.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– We're very sorry, too, sir!\N– We're very sorry, too, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.03,0:11:58.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,After today, these two will be\Nkicked out of the marines for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.60,0:12:03.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The two of you are truly lost causes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.10,0:12:05.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know anyone who\Nwould take you in now,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.10,0:12:08.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but turning you loose would\Nonly burden the public.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.90,0:12:11.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have no choice but to take you\Nwith me to Marine Headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.84,0:12:14.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What, Vice-Admiral?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.04,0:12:17.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Sir, you're actually going to take these\Ntwo chore boys with you to headquarters?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.58,0:12:18.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.44,0:12:21.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course not. No problem here, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.04,0:12:23.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And do you two have a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.24,0:12:26.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you want to run away,\Nthis is your last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.15,0:12:29.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not that I'd allow you to\Nget very far, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.52,0:12:32.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, now. It certainly has\Nbeen an interesting day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.59,0:12:49.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.82,0:12:51.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Marine Headquarters?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.66,0:12:52.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.79,0:12:56.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vice-Admiral Garp can be\Nvery unpredictable at times.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.88,0:13:00.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's pretty high up\Non the food chain though, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.28,0:13:02.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, very high up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.22,0:13:07.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Then those two must have been very promising\Nto have caught his attention like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.79,0:13:12.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stupid! Stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.79,0:13:15.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stupid! Stupid! Stupid! Stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.06,0:13:17.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why did you let them go\Nwithout saying goodbye?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.47,0:13:19.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stupid! Stupid! Stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.59,0:13:24.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I still wanted to play\Nwith them some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.06,0:13:26.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I wanted to talk to them more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.37,0:13:30.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was even learning how to cook.\NI wanted to make them a yummy
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.54,0:13:35.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,lunch next time they came\Nover but... but now I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.22,0:13:39.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I didn't even get to... to say\Ngoodbye before they left!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.52,0:13:42.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.03,0:13:44.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why did they have to leave?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.36,0:13:46.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahh! I'm sorry. Please forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.83,0:13:48.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Rika, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.00,0:13:50.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Leave him alone now, dear.\NYou don't have to be so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.96,0:13:55.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They'll come back after they've\Nbecome fine marine officers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.14,0:14:02.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Uh, what good is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.78,0:14:05.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}How are we supposed to become\Nmarines by mopping floors?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.98,0:14:07.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Did you ever think that\Nmaybe this is just a hobby
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.88,0:14:09.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that old geezer has?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.32,0:14:10.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A hobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.25,0:14:11.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.52,0:14:14.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A new hobby called "tormenting\Npoor chore boys just for fun."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.32,0:14:16.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, the\Nold man's crazy enough
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.22,0:14:18.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that it might be true.\NThink about it for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.19,0:14:20.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Would you birds stop chirping?!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=21}===============================DIALOGUE============================
